  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  talkDistance: 7.5
  texts:
  - There are two kinds of beans. Big brown and small red. Both of them are very
    important
  - The brown beans are money that you can use to buy new weapons from Billy and
    Jimmy. The red ones restore your health
  - Try to collect all the beans to defeat the enemy. Good luck
