  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  talkDistance: 7.5
  texts:
  - This is the entrance to the laboratory. But, unfortunately, the elevator is broken.
    You'll have to jump down
  - But don't worry. You won't get hurt because there is a trampoline at the bottom.
    It's absolutely safe
  - While you will be falling, shoot at the green buttons. Try to hit them
  - Another important thing. When you wiil be in the underground laboratory you need
    to shoot the big brown beans to make them drop "coins"
  - The currency for which you can upgrade your weapons is also beans, oddly enough.
    Collect them all to earn money faster
  - That's all. You shoul handle it
  eIcon: {fileID: 1696980565}
  _talkPanel: {fileID: 1077081507}
  _Self: {fileID: 1379450974}
  giveSomethingInTheEnd: 0
