    - target: {fileID: 5183582028017780374, guid: 12fcdccc93431964e9cd57e44e6dd364, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _Self
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1465741824}
    - target: {fileID: 5183582028017780374, guid: 12fcdccc93431964e9cd57e44e6dd364, type: 3}
      propertyPath: eIcon
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1696980565}
    - target: {fileID: 5183582028017780374, guid: 12fcdccc93431964e9cd57e44e6dd364, type: 3}
      propertyPath: _talkPanel
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 1077081507}
    - target: {fileID: 5183582028017780374, guid: 12fcdccc93431964e9cd57e44e6dd364, type: 3}
      propertyPath: talkDistance
      value: 7.5
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5183582028017780374, guid: 12fcdccc93431964e9cd57e44e6dd364, type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.size
      value: 8
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5183582028017780374, guid: 12fcdccc93431964e9cd57e44e6dd364, type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[0]
      value: Oh, my dear grandson, how long I waited for you!
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5183582028017780374, guid: 12fcdccc93431964e9cd57e44e6dd364, type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[1]
      value: Heard something strange from the residents? Oh, and what unusual can
        this old man do?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5183582028017780374, guid: 12fcdccc93431964e9cd57e44e6dd364, type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[2]
      value: Recently, I tried to increase the yield of beans. Do you remember my
        greenhouses?
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5183582028017780374, guid: 12fcdccc93431964e9cd57e44e6dd364, type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[3]
      value: By the way... There is a small underground laboratory there.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5183582028017780374, guid: 12fcdccc93431964e9cd57e44e6dd364, type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[4]
      value: But my experiments got a little out of control.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5183582028017780374, guid: 12fcdccc93431964e9cd57e44e6dd364, type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[5]
      value: And now the robobean-killer I accidentally created wants to destroy
        humanity.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5183582028017780374, guid: 12fcdccc93431964e9cd57e44e6dd364, type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[6]
      value: So you have to save the world, grandson. We believe in you.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5183582028017780374, guid: 12fcdccc93431964e9cd57e44e6dd364, type: 3}
      propertyPath: texts.Array.data[7]
      value: Keep the rifle and 100 beans. You will deal with everything else as
        the case progresses.
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5183582028017780374, guid: 12fcdccc93431964e9cd57e44e6dd364, type: 3}
      propertyPath: giveSomethingInTheEnd
      value: 1
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5938092135539379510, guid: 12fcdccc93431964e9cd57e44e6dd364, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_StaticEditorFlags
      value: 4294967295
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6520986593798289763, guid: 12fcdccc93431964e9cd57e44e6dd364, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_StaticEditorFlags
      value: 4294967295
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6673639251765266471, guid: 12fcdccc93431964e9cd57e44e6dd364, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_Materials.Array.data[0]
      value: 
      objectReference: {fileID: 2100000, guid: 933ab0c37b33664428f0141e13bf2d10, type: 2}
